6848	// ================= FA4-FAITHFUL warp-specialized kernel (fwd_kernel_fa4) =====================
6849	// Reimplements the CUTLASS FA4 structure: ONE 256-row Q tile = 2 STACKED 128-row halves sharing K/V.
6850	// 16 warps: w0-3 Softmax0(rows0-127), w4-7 Softmax1(rows128-255), w8-11 Correction, w12 MMA,
6851	// w13 Load(TMA K/V), w14 Epilogue, w15 Empty. tmem: S0@0 S1@128 P0@0 P1@128(alias S) O0@256 O1@384.
6852	// Pipelines (all depth-1 except KV ring; Q preloaded so no Q pipe; order_s01 omitted, perf-only):
6853	//   KV (Load->MMA), S0/S1 (MMA->Softmax, P-ready via p_full), C0/C1 (Softmax->Corr, stats via smem),
6854	//   O0/O1 (MMA->Corr), E (Corr->Epilogue, sO smem).  Stats (corr factor + final sum/max) travel via
6855	//   smem (sScale/sFin*) gated by the C barriers (like ws2), not tmem V0/V1.  Q is PRESCALED by
6856	//   scale*log2e at load, so softmax is p=ex2(S-m) and the corr factor is ex2(m_old-m_new).
